{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.Generators","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.Generators","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Defs"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.FarCommutativity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.FarCommutativity","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L75-L81","doc":"Far-commutativity (H3):\nσ_i σ_j = σ_j σ_i  whenever |i - j| ≥ 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.BraidRelation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.BraidRelation","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L65-L73","doc":"Braid relation predicate (H2):\n    σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i = σ_{i+1} σ_i σ_{i+1}\nfor adjacent generators. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.HeckeQuadratic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.HeckeQuadratic","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L50-L63","doc":"Hecke relation predicate (H1):\n    σ_i² = (q - q⁻¹) σ_i + 1\nin any algebra `A` over `R` with σ_i interpreted via `embed`.\n\nWe require `[Inv R]` so that `q⁻¹` elaborates; mathematical\nwell-posedness additionally needs `q` to be a unit, which\ndownstream `HeckeAlgebra` instances enforce by working over a\nfield or by providing a unit witness. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Generator.farCommuting","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Generator.farCommuting","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L43-L46","doc":"Two generators are *far-commuting* iff their indices differ by\nat least 2 (equivalently, are not equal and not adjacent). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Generator.adjacent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Generator.adjacent","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L39-L41","doc":"Two generators are *adjacent* iff their indices differ by exactly 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.instDecidableEqGenerator.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.instDecidableEqGenerator.decEq","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.instDecidableEqGenerator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.instDecidableEqGenerator","kind":"instance","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Generator.idx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Generator.idx","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Generator index, 0-based; corresponds to σ_{idx+1} in the\nliterature's 1-based convention. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Generator.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Generator.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.Generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.Generator","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/Generators.lean#L29-L35","doc":"A Hecke generator at index `i` for an algebra of strand count `n`.\nThe condition `1 ≤ i ≤ n - 1` is encoded via `Fin (n - 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}